==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈlɪstɪŋ/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Persent101-listing.wav|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪstɪŋ|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# As [[list]]ed or shown on a listing.
#: {{ux|en|What is this house's '''listing''' price?}}

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{infl of|en|list||ing-form}}
#: {{ux|en|The ship is '''listing''' heavily to one side.}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The action of the verb to [[list]].
# An [[entry]] in a list or [[directory]].
#: {{ux|en|Aardvaark Plumbing is the first '''listing''' in Yellow Pages.}}
## {{senseid|en|register of securities}} An entry on a register of securities accepted for trading and quotation on a securities exchange or similar system.
##: {{ux|en|The company may even lose its '''listing''' on the stock exchange.}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} A [[printout]] of a [[program]] or [[data set]].
#: {{ux|en|Print me a '''listing''' of the latest version.}}
# A physical manifestation of a single item in a list.
#: {{ux|en|Please pass me the second '''listing''' for the two-story house, from that stack.}}
# The act of [[plough]]ing with a [[lister]].

